      "search:sku": "007V-06362",
      "search:title": "rSARS-CoV-2_∆E-GFP_3*",
      "search:description": "Recombinant chimeric SARS-CoV-2 with a STOP codon in ORF3a. ∆E-based vaccine virus needs to be propagated on E-transcomplementing cells (Ref-SKU: 007S-06365). Green fluorescent protein (GFP) is in the coding frame of deleted SARS-CoV-2 envelope gene. Virus was obtained as described in doi: 10.1038/s41541-024-00992-z .",
      "search:taxonLabel": "Riboviria, Orthornavirae, Pisuviricota, Pisoniviricetes, Nidovirales, Cornidovirineae, Coronaviridae, Orthocoronavirinae, Betacoronavirus",
