      "search:description": "Vero-E2T cells express SARS-CoV-2 E/ORF6/ORF7a/ORF8 genes, under the CMV promoter. Human TMPRSS2 expression in Vero-E2T was achieved by infecting the cells with a 2nd generation lentiviral vector pLEX307-TMPRSS2-blast (Addgene plasmid #158458) as a transfer vector. This cell line is needed for SARS-CoV-2 ∆E vaccine virus propagation.",
