      "dcterms:issued": "2026-03-25T13:28:30+01:00",
      "dcterms:modified": "2026-03-25T13:33:10+01:00",
      "dcterms:title": "HEK293T-indE",
      "dcterms:description": "HEK293T-indE (HEK293T-E Tet:E-IRES-ORF6) cells are a derivative of HEK293T-E with a second-generation lentiviral vector generated with the pCW57-E-IRES-ORF6 (Addgene plasmid #80921) as a transfer vector. The vector codes for SARS-COV-2 E and ORF6 under a Tetracycline inducible promoter. Cell line is needed for recovery of ∆E-based vaccine virus, which needs to be propagated on E-transcomplementing cells.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "1 mL cryo-preserved cells",
