      "search:title": "pUC19_CoV-2_ frD2_∆E ∆orf6 ∆orf7a orf3a* VSVG-P2A-N",
      "search:description": "Template for chimeric SARS-CoV-2 rescue; encodes fragment D2 of SARS-CoV-2 (nt25422-29867), with deletion of E, orf6, orf7a and a premature stop codon at position 213 in orf3a. The VSV-G gene is introduced upstream of N, separated by P2A. ∆E-based viruses need to be rescued and propagated on E-transcomplementing cells. Full protocol for virus recovery using the CLEVER method in (10.7554/eLife.89035).",
