      "search:title": "recombinant chimeric SARS-CoV-2; Omicron BA.5 lineage with BA.1 Spike",
      "search:description": "Recombinant SARS-CoV-2, chimeric virus with Omicron BA.5 background and BA.1 Spike sequence. Virus was produced using the CLEVER method as described in (doi: 10.7554/eLife.89035). Region of interest sequenced.",
