      "search:sku": "006N-03082",
      "search:title": "HIV-1 pNL-BX_pr-M46I",
      "search:description": "Plasmid contains the entire genome of HIV-1 with specific mutations in the protease gene, which can confer drug resistance to specific HIV-1 PR inhibitors. The respective mutations have been reported in viruses from HIV-infected individuals on PR inhibitors with virologic therapy failure.",
